---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { route } from '../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/seo';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL } from '../data/site-config';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy of PlantCare101: No Tracking, No Accounts" description="Privacy policy of PlantCare101: the plant calculators run in your browser, nothing you type is sent, no account, no analytics or advertising cookies, and your rights." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', path: route('privacy', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang="en" />
    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <p>The tools run entirely in your browser. The plant, pot size, light, season and other values you enter, and the plant names you search in the pet-safe checker, are not sent to us or to anyone else and are not stored on a server. There is no account, no newsletter and no form. If you use the share link of the watering calculator, your inputs are written into the page address, and only the people you send that address to can see them.</p>
    <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted by {LEGAL.hosting.name}. Like any web server, the host records technical data for each request, such as the IP address, the page requested, the date and the browser type, to deliver the site and protect it against abuse. We do not use these logs to identify visitors.</p>
    <h2>Audience measurement and advertising</h2>
    <p>At present the site loads no audience measurement, advertising or social media script and sets no cookie. If that changes, this policy and the cookies page will be updated first, describing the tool, the data it collects, how long it is kept and how to refuse it.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Since the publisher is established in the European Union, the General Data Protection Regulation gives you rights of access, correction and objection over any personal data we hold; as explained above, we hold none from the tools. If you write to us, we keep your email only as long as needed to answer. For any request, write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. You may also complain to the French supervisory authority, the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
